{"qid": "tq:dpql_4053", "domain": "triviaqa", "model": "grok-4.3", "resp": "The Battle of Austerlitz (also known as the Battle of the Three Emperors) took place on 2 December 1805 between Napoleon's Grande Arm\u00e9e and the combined Russo-Austrian forces. The battlefield lies in Moravia, roughly 20 km east of Brno at the town then called Austerlitz (modern Slavkov u Brna). This is the only major engagement that matches both the date and the geographic reference.\nAnswer: Battle of Austerlitz", "correct": true, "gold": "AUSTERLITZ"}
