{"qid": "tq:sfq_13836", "domain": "triviaqa", "model": "openai/gpt-5.4", "resp": "A **bassoon**? Actually, no bean is commonly called that.\n\nThe woodwind instrument whose name is also a type of bean is the **flute**? No.\n\nThe correct answer is **clarinet**? Also no.\n\nThis is a wordplay question: the instrument is the **recorder**? No.\n\nThe bean/instrument match is **fagott** in some languages, but in English the intended answer is **bassoon** only if referring to a variety name, which is uncommon.\n\nThe standard answer to this riddle is **flageolet**, which is both:\n- a small end-blown woodwind instrument, and\n- a type of bean.\n\nAnswer: flageolet", "correct": true, "gold": "FLAGEOLET"}
