{"qid": "tq:qw_12302", "domain": "triviaqa", "model": "Kimi-K2.5", "resp": "The film is **Meet Me in St. Louis**. \n\nThis 1944 musical classic was Vincente Minnelli's second feature film and his first major success. It tells the story of the Smith family living in St. Louis during the year leading up to the 1904 Louisiana Purchase Exposition (World's Fair). Judy Garland plays Esther Smith, Margaret O'Brien plays her little sister Tootie (winning a special Academy Award for her performance), Mary Astor and Leon Ames play the parents, and Marjorie Main plays the housekeeper Katie. The film features iconic songs including \"Have Yourself a Merry Little Christmas\" and \"The Trolley Song.\"\n\nAnswer: Meet Me in St. Louis", "correct": true, "gold": "Meet Me In St. Louis"}
