{"qid": "tq:qw_12302", "domain": "triviaqa", "model": "grok-4.3", "resp": "The film in question is set in St. Louis in 1903\u20131904 and centers on the Smith family\u2019s anticipation of the Louisiana Purchase Exposition (the 1904 World\u2019s Fair). Its director, Vincente Minnelli, and principal cast\u2014Judy Garland (as Esther Smith), Margaret O\u2019Brien (as Tootie), Mary Astor (as Mrs. Smith), Leon Ames (as Mr. Smith), and Marjorie Main (as Katie the maid)\u2014match the query exactly. Contemporary studio records and filmographies confirm that the picture, released by MGM in November 1944, is the well-known musical Meet Me in St. Louis.\nAnswer: Meet Me in St. Louis", "correct": true, "gold": "Meet Me In St. Louis"}
