{"qid": "tq:dpql_4756", "domain": "triviaqa", "model": "grok-4.3", "resp": "Joseph Stilwell (full name: Joseph Warren Stilwell) was a senior U.S. Army commander in the China-Burma-India theater. His blunt, acidic personality earned him the nickname \u201cVinegar Joe\u201d from both subordinates and the press; the moniker is well-documented in wartime dispatches and postwar histories.\nAnswer: Joseph Stilwell", "correct": true, "gold": "Stillwell"}
