{"qid": "tq:sfq_610", "domain": "triviaqa", "model": "anthropic/claude-sonnet-5", "resp": "Posset is a traditional drink made by curdling hot milk with wine or ale and adding spices, popular during the Middle Ages.\n\nAnswer: Posset", "correct": true, "gold": "A POSSET"}
