{"qid": "tq:tb_960", "domain": "triviaqa", "model": "Kimi-K2.5", "resp": "The episode in question is \"Blame It on Lisa\" (Season 13, Episode 15), which aired in March 2002 and depicted the Simpson family traveling to Brazil. The episode included scenes showing Bart being swallowed by a boa constrictor (among other stereotypical and negative depictions of the country), which prompted the tourism board of **Rio de Janeiro** to threaten a defamation lawsuit against Fox. \n\nThe hint refers to Rio hosting the 2014 FIFA World Cup and the 2016 Summer Olympics.\n\nAnswer: Rio de Janeiro", "correct": true, "gold": "Rio"}
