{"qid": "tq:dpql_475", "domain": "triviaqa", "model": "openai/gpt-5.4", "resp": "Agricultural lime is primarily **calcium carbonate (CaCO\u2083)**, though some products may also contain **magnesium carbonate** if they are sold as dolomitic lime.\n\nAnswer: Calcium carbonate (CaCO\u2083)", "correct": true, "gold": "CALCIUM CARBONATE"}
