{"qid": "gsm:8", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "DeepSeek-V4-Flash", "resp": "Let\u2019s break it down.\n\n- The 20th anniversary means 20 years have passed since Digimon came out.\n- When it came out, John was twice as old as Jim.\n- John is 28 now, so 20 years ago John was \\( 28 - 20 = 8 \\) years old.\n- At that time, John was twice Jim\u2019s age, so Jim was \\( 8 \\div 2 = 4 \\) years old.\n- Now, 20 years later, Jim is \\( 4 + 20 = 24 \\) years old.\n\nAnswer: 24", "correct": true, "gold": "24"}
