{"qid": "gsm:10", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "anthropic/claude-sonnet-5", "resp": "**Setting up the problem:**\n- Each plant is 1 foot wide (12 inches)\n- Space between plants: 1.5 feet\n- Total bed length: 111 feet\n\n**Finding total plants needed:**\n\nFor n plants, there are (n-1) gaps between them.\n\nTotal length = n(1 foot) + (n-1)(1.5 feet) = 111\n\nn + 1.5n - 1.5 = 111\n2.5n = 112.5\nn = 45 plants needed\n\n**Calculating cost:**\n\nPlants Pat needs to buy = 45 - 17 = 28 plants\n\nCost = 28 \u00d7 $6 = $168\n\nAnswer: $168", "correct": false, "gold": "342"}
