{"qid": "gsm:22", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "openai/gpt-5.4", "resp": "Total bikes sold = 300.\n\n- Trekking: half of 300 = 150 bikes\n- BMX: 15% of 300 = 45 bikes\n- MTB: remaining = 300 - 150 - 45 = 105 bikes\n\nPrices:\n- MTB = $500\n- BMX = half of $500 = $250\n- Trekking = $450\n\nRevenue:\n- MTB: 105 \u00d7 500 = $52,500\n- BMX: 45 \u00d7 250 = $11,250\n- Trekking: 150 \u00d7 450 = $67,500\n\nTotal earned:\n52,500 + 11,250 + 67,500 = $131,250\n\nAnswer: $131,250", "correct": true, "gold": "131250"}
