{"qid": "gsm:24", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "DeepSeek-V4-Flash", "resp": "We know Peter's locker is 5 cubic inches.  \nPeter's locker is 1/4 as big as Zack's locker, so Zack's locker is 4 times Peter's:  \nZack = 4 \u00d7 5 = 20 cubic inches.  \n\nZack's locker is half as big as Timothy's, so Timothy's locker is twice as big as Zack's:  \nTimothy = 2 \u00d7 20 = 40 cubic inches.  \n\nAnswer: 40", "correct": true, "gold": "40"}
