{"qid": "gsm:25", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "Kimi-K2.5", "resp": "Total trucks dispatched: 20  \nTons per truck: 20  \nTotal tons dispatched: 20 \u00d7 20 = 400 tons  \n\nTrucks with mechanical failures: \u00bc \u00d7 20 = 5 trucks  \nTons lost due to failures: 5 \u00d7 20 = 100 tons  \n\nTons that reached farmers: 400 \u2212 100 = 300 tons  \n(or 15 successful trucks \u00d7 20 tons = 300 tons)  \n\nAnswer: 300 tons", "correct": true, "gold": "300"}
