{"qid": "gsm:26", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "DeepSeek-V4-Flash", "resp": "Let Donovan's part take \\( d \\) minutes.  \nThen Betsy's part takes \\( d + 18 \\) minutes.  \nTogether:  \n\\[\nd + (d + 18) = 98\n\\]  \n\\[\n2d + 18 = 98\n\\]  \n\\[\n2d = 80\n\\]  \n\\[\nd = 40\n\\]  \nSo Betsy's part is \\( 40 + 18 = 58 \\) minutes.\n\nAnswer: 58", "correct": true, "gold": "58"}
{"qid": "gsm:25", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "Cohere-command-a-plus-05-2026", "resp": "<|START_TEXT|>The total fertilizer initially dispatched is \\(20 \\text{ trucks} \\times 20 \\text{ tons/truck} = 400 \\text{ tons}\\).\n\nA quarter of the trucks failed: \\(\\frac{1}{4} \\times 20 = 5\\) trucks.  \nThese 5 trucks did not deliver any fertilizer.\n\nThe remaining trucks that succeeded: \\(20 - 5 = 15\\) trucks.  \nFertilizer delivered by these trucks: \\(15 \\text{ trucks} \\times 20 \\text{ tons/truck} = 300 \\text{ tons}\\).\n\nAnswer: 300 tons.<|END_TEXT|>", "correct": true, "gold": "300"}
