{"qid": "gsm:38", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "openai/gpt-5.4", "resp": "Let \\(c\\) be the number of camels and \\(d\\) the number of dromedaries.\n\nHeads:\n\\[\nc + d = 180\n\\]\n\nHumps:\n\\[\n2c + d = 304\n\\]\n\nSubtract the first equation from the second:\n\\[\n(2c + d) - (c + d) = 304 - 180\n\\]\n\\[\nc = 124\n\\]\n\nThen:\n\\[\nd = 180 - 124 = 56\n\\]\n\nAnswer: 56", "correct": true, "gold": "56"}
