{"qid": "gsm:54", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "openai/gpt-5.4", "resp": "Let Bahati\u2019s points be \\(B\\), Azibo\u2019s be \\(A\\), and Dinar\u2019s be \\(D\\).\n\nWe know:\n- \\(B + A + D = 45\\)\n- \\(B = A + 20\\)\n- \\(B = D + 10\\), so \\(D = B - 10\\)\n\nSubstitute into the total:\n\\[\nB + (B - 20) + (B - 10) = 45\n\\]\n\\[\n3B - 30 = 45\n\\]\n\\[\n3B = 75\n\\]\n\\[\nB = 25\n\\]\n\nThen Azibo scored:\n\\[\nA = B - 20 = 25 - 20 = 5\n\\]\n\nAnswer: 5", "correct": true, "gold": "5"}
{"qid": "gsm:54", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "DeepSeek-V4-Flash", "resp": "Let\u2019s define Bahati\u2019s points as \\( B \\), Azibo\u2019s as \\( A \\), and Dinar\u2019s as \\( D \\).  \n\nWe know:  \n- \\( B = A + 20 \\)  \n- \\( B = D + 10 \\)  \n- \\( B + A + D = 45 \\)  \n\nFrom the first two:  \n\\( A = B - 20 \\) and \\( D = B - 10 \\).  \n\nSubstitute into total:  \n\\[\nB + (B - 20) + (B - 10) = 45\n\\]  \n\\[\n3B - 30 = 45\n\\]  \n\\[\n3B = 75\n\\]  \n\\[\nB = 25\n\\]  \n\nThen Azibo\u2019s points:  \n\\[\nA = 25 - 20 = 5\n\\]  \n\nAnswer: 5", "correct": true, "gold": "5"}
{"qid": "gsm:54", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "anthropic/claude-sonnet-5", "resp": "Bahati scored 25 points (since B + (B-20) + (B-10) = 45 \u2192 3B = 75 \u2192 B = 25).\n\nAzibo scored B - 20 = 25 - 20 = 5.\n\nAnswer: 5", "correct": true, "gold": "5"}
{"qid": "gsm:54", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "Kimi-K2.5", "resp": "Let $B$, $A$, and $D$ represent the points scored by Bahati, Azibo, and Dinar, respectively.\n\nFrom the problem:\n- $B + A + D = 45$ (total points)\n- $B = A + 20$ (Bahati scored 20 more than Azibo)\n- $B = D + 10$ (Bahati scored 10 more than Dinar)\n\nFrom the second equation: $A = B - 20$\nFrom the third equation: $D = B - 10$\n\nSubstituting into the first equation:\n$$B + (B - 20) + (B - 10) = 45$$\n$$3B - 30 = 45$$\n$$3B = 75$$\n$$B = 25$$\n\nTherefore:\n$$A = 25 - 20 = 5$$\n\nAnswer: 5", "correct": true, "gold": "5"}
