{"qid": "gsm:61", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "openai/gpt-5.4", "resp": "First half:\n- Team A scores 4 goals.\n- Team B scores 2 fewer, so Team B scores 2 goals.\n\nSecond half:\n- Team B scores 4 times its first-half goals: \\(4 \\times 2 = 8\\).\n- Team A scores \\( \\frac{1}{4} \\) of Team B\u2019s second-half goals: \\( \\frac{1}{4} \\times 8 = 2\\).\n\nTotal goals:\n- First half: \\(4 + 2 = 6\\)\n- Second half: \\(2 + 8 = 10\\)\n\nTotal match goals: \\(6 + 10 = 16\\)\n\nAnswer: 16", "correct": true, "gold": "16"}
