{"qid": "gsm:67", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "grok-4.3", "resp": "The base prices are $35 for a manicure and $40 for a pedicure. Adding these together gives a subtotal of $75. The salon discount of 20% is applied only to this combined manicure-plus-pedicure service, which reduces the subtotal by \\(0.2 \\times 75 = 15\\), leaving a discounted total of \\(75 - 15 = 60\\).\n\nNail art is an add-on charged separately at $3 per nail and is not included in the discount. Because the request specifies nail art on fingers (not toes), the standard count of 10 fingernails applies, producing an extra charge of \\(10 \\times 3 = 30\\).\n\nAdding the discounted service total to the nail-art charge yields the final amount: \\(60 + 30 = 90\\).\n\nAnswer: 90", "correct": true, "gold": "90"}
{"qid": "gsm:69", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "Kimi-K2.5", "resp": "Here's the step-by-step calculation:\n\n**Distribution of questions:**\n- Easy: $40\\% \\times 60 = 24$ questions\n- Remaining: $60 - 24 = 36$ questions\n- Average: $36 \\div 2 = 18$ questions\n- Difficult: $36 \\div 2 = 18$ questions\n\n**Aries's correct answers:**\n- Easy: $75\\% \\times 24 = 18$ questions\n- Average: $50\\% \\times 18 = 9$ questions\n- Difficult: $50\\% \\times 18 = 9$ questions\n\n**Total points:** $18 + 9 + 9 = 36$\n\nAnswer: 36", "correct": true, "gold": "36"}
