{"qid": "gsm:80", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "DeepSeek-V4-Flash", "resp": "Let's go step-by-step:\n\n1. Each pole has 4 street lights.  \n2. Each intersection has 6 poles \u2192 lights per intersection = \\( 6 \\times 4 = 24 \\).  \n3. There are 4 intersections \u2192 total lights = \\( 24 \\times 4 = 96 \\).  \n4. 20 lights are not working \u2192 functioning lights = \\( 96 - 20 = 76 \\).\n\nAnswer: 76", "correct": true, "gold": "76"}
