{"qid": "gsm:78", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "grok-4.3", "resp": "There are 90 people who form groups of 9, which means there are exactly 10 groups in total.\n\nOf those groups, \\(\\frac{3}{5}\\) participate in bringing seashells, which is 6 groups.\n\nEach of those 6 groups consists of 9 members, and each member brings back 2 seashells.\n\nMultiplying through therefore gives the total: \\(6 \\times 9 \\times 2 = 108\\).\n\nAnswer: 108", "correct": true, "gold": "108"}
{"qid": "gsm:82", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "anthropic/claude-sonnet-5", "resp": "Maggie's oven runs at 468/450 = 1.04 times the set temperature (4% high).\n\nTo get an actual temperature of 520\u00b0, she needs to set it to:\n\n520 \u00f7 1.04 = 500\n\nAnswer: 500 degrees", "correct": true, "gold": "500"}
