{"qid": "gsm:85", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "openai/gpt-5.4", "resp": "Let the number of queens be \\(q\\).\n\nThen:\n- babies \\(= 2q\\)\n- workers \\(= 2 \\times 2q = 4q\\)\n\nTotal bees:\n\\[\nq + 2q + 4q = 7q = 700\n\\]\n\nSo:\n\\[\nq = 100\n\\]\n\nWorker bees:\n\\[\n4q = 400\n\\]\n\nAnswer: 400", "correct": true, "gold": "400"}
