{"qid": "gsm:91", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "openai/gpt-5.4", "resp": "She has 6 bird feeders total: 3 homemade and 3 store-bought.\n\n- Store-bought feeders attract 20 birds each:\n  3 \u00d7 20 = 60\n- Homemade feeders attract 10 more than that, so 30 birds each:\n  3 \u00d7 30 = 90\n\nTotal birds each day:\n60 + 90 = 150\n\nAnswer: 150", "correct": true, "gold": "150"}
{"qid": "gsm:90", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "Cohere-command-a-plus-05-2026", "resp": "<|START_TEXT|>By midday, \\( \\frac{2}{5} \\) of 5000 people voted:  \n\\( \\frac{2}{5} \\times 5000 = 2000 \\) voted, leaving \\( 5000 - 2000 = 3000 \\) still waiting.\n\nBy 16:00, \\( \\frac{2}{3} \\) of those remaining voted:  \n\\( \\frac{2}{3} \\times 3000 = 2000 \\) voted in this period.\n\nTotal voted by 16:00 = \\( 2000 + 2000 = 4000 \\).\n\nPeople who had not voted by 16:00 = \\( 5000 - 4000 = 1000 \\).\n\nAnswer: 1000<|END_TEXT|>", "correct": true, "gold": "1000"}
