{"qid": "gsm:91", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "DeepSeek-V4-Flash", "resp": "Let\u2019s break it down:\n\n- Lillian has 3 homemade feeders and 3 store-bought feeders.  \n- Each store-bought feeder attracts 20 birds.  \n- Each homemade feeder attracts 20 + 10 = 30 birds.  \n\nTotal birds:  \nFrom store-bought: 3 \u00d7 20 = 60  \nFrom homemade: 3 \u00d7 30 = 90  \n\nTotal = 60 + 90 = 150 birds.\n\nAnswer: 150", "correct": true, "gold": "150"}
