{"qid": "gsm:102", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "DeepSeek-V4-Flash", "resp": "Let's break it down step by step.\n\n- First 5 years:  \n  Cost per visit = $2  \n  Visits per year = 3  \n  Total visits in 5 years = 5 \u00d7 3 = 15  \n  Cost for these = 15 \u00d7 $2 = $30  \n\n- After 5 years, cost increases by 150%:  \n  150% of $2 = $3  \n  New cost per visit = $2 + $3 = $5  \n\n- Next 3 years:  \n  Visits per year = 3  \n  Total visits = 3 \u00d7 3 = 9  \n  Cost for these = 9 \u00d7 $5 = $45  \n\n- Total spent over all 8 years:  \n  $30 + $45 = $75  \n\nAnswer: $75", "correct": true, "gold": "75"}
