{"qid": "gsm:104", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "openai/gpt-5.4", "resp": "He starts with \\$6000 and wants to keep \\$2000 saved, so he can spend:\n\n\\$6000 - \\$2000 = \\$4000\n\nNow find his other expenses:\n\n- 6 business suits at \\$100 each:  \n  6 \u00d7 100 = \\$600\n\n- 3 suitcases at \\$50 each:  \n  3 \u00d7 50 = \\$150\n\n- Flight ticket costs \\$700 more than 5 times a suit:  \n  5 \u00d7 100 = \\$500  \n  \\$500 + \\$700 = \\$1200\n\nTotal spent before gifts:\n\n\\$600 + \\$150 + \\$1200 = \\$1950\n\nMoney left for gifts:\n\n\\$4000 - \\$1950 = \\$2050\n\nAnswer: \\$2050", "correct": true, "gold": "2050"}
