{"qid": "gsm:105", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "grok-4.3", "resp": "The route forms a loop with these segments:  \n- City 1 to City 2: 75 mi  \n- City 2 to City 3: 100 mi  \n- Combined so far = 175 mi, so City 3 to City 1 = 175 \u2212 50 = 125 mi  \n\nOne full loop therefore totals 75 + 100 + 125 = 300 mi.  \nThree loops per day produce 900 mi/day.  \nService is required every 18 000 mi, so the interval is 18 000 / 900 = 20 days.\n\nAnswer: 20 days", "correct": true, "gold": "20"}
