{"qid": "gsm:104", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "grok-4.3", "resp": "The total budget is $6000, of which $2000 is set aside as savings. This leaves a spending budget of $4000.\n\nItemized costs:  \n- Suits: \\(6 \\times 100 = 600\\)  \n- Suitcases: \\(3 \\times 50 = 150\\)  \n- Flight: \\(5 \\times 100 + 700 = 1200\\)  \n\nTotal of the above purchases: \\(600 + 150 + 1200 = 1950\\).  \n\nAmount remaining for gifts: \\(4000 - 1950 = 2050\\).\n\nAnswer: 2050", "correct": true, "gold": "2050"}
