{"qid": "gsm:104", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "MAI-Thinking-1", "resp": "**Calculation:** \r\n\r\n1. **Total money:** $6000\r\n2. **Business suits:** 6 \u00d7 $100 = $600\r\n3. **Suitcases:** 3 \u00d7 $50 = $150\r\n4. **Flight ticket:** 5 \u00d7 $100 + $700 = $500 + $700 = $1200\r\n5. **Total expenses so far:** $600 + $150 + $1200 = $1950\r\n6. **Savings:** $2000\r\n7. **Gifts budget:** $6000 - $1950 - $2000 = $2050\r\n\r\nAnswer: $2050", "correct": true, "gold": "2050"}
{"qid": "gsm:105", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "Cohere-command-a-plus-05-2026", "resp": "<|START_TEXT|>The train\u2019s route consists of three legs:\n\n- First to second: 75\u202fmi  \n- Second to third: 100\u202fmi  \n- Third back to first: 50\u202fmi less than the combined distance of the first two legs  \n\nCombined distance of the first two legs = 75\u202fmi + 100\u202fmi = 175\u202fmi.  \nThird leg distance = 175\u202fmi \u2013 50\u202fmi = 125\u202fmi.\n\nTotal distance per full loop = 75\u202fmi + 100\u202fmi + 125\u202fmi = 300\u202fmi.\n\nThe train makes this loop 3 times each day, so daily mileage = 300\u202fmi \u00d7 3 = 900\u202fmi.\n\nService is required every 18,000\u202fmi.  \nNumber of days between services = 18,000\u202fmi \u00f7 900\u202fmi/day = 20\u202fdays.\n\nAnswer: 20 days<|END_TEXT|>", "correct": true, "gold": "20"}
