{"qid": "gsm:107", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "DeepSeek-V4-Flash", "resp": "We have identical octuplets, so 8 babies total.\n\n- Purple: \\( \\frac{3}{4} \\times 8 = 6 \\) babies  \n- Blue: \\( \\frac{1}{4} \\times 8 = 2 \\) babies  \n\nNow, babies wearing bows:  \n- All blue-wearers: 2 babies  \n- \\( \\frac{1}{3} \\) of purple-wearers: \\( \\frac{1}{3} \\times 6 = 2 \\) babies  \n\nTotal with bows = \\( 2 + 2 = 4 \\) babies.\n\nAmong these, the number wearing purple is 2.\n\nProbability = \\( \\frac{2}{4} = 0.5 = 50\\% \\).\n\nAnswer: 50%", "correct": true, "gold": "50"}
{"qid": "gsm:107", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "openai/gpt-5.4", "resp": "There are 8 babies total.\n\n- Purple: \\( \\frac{3}{4} \\times 8 = 6 \\)\n- Blue: \\( \\frac{1}{4} \\times 8 = 2 \\)\n\nAll blue-wearers wear bows:\n- Blue with bows = 2\n\nOne-third of purple-wearers wear bows:\n- Purple with bows = \\( \\frac{1}{3} \\times 6 = 2 \\)\n\nSo total babies wearing bows:\n- \\(2 + 2 = 4\\)\n\nOf those 4 babies with bows, 2 are wearing purple.\n\nSo the probability is:\n\\[\n\\frac{2}{4} = \\frac{1}{2} = 50\\%\n\\]\n\nAnswer: 50%", "correct": true, "gold": "50"}
