{"qid": "gsm:108", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "Kimi-K2.5", "resp": "Let $e$, $b$, and $t$ represent the number of enemies, berries, and seconds left for Emma.\n\n**Emma's score:** $10e + 5b + 30t$\n\n**Ava's stats:**\n- Enemies: $e + 8$\n- Berries: $b + 3$  \n- Seconds left: $t - 4$ (4 seconds slower means 4 fewer seconds remaining)\n\n**Ava's score:** \n$$10(e+8) + 5(b+3) + 30(t-4)$$\n$$= 10e + 80 + 5b + 15 + 30t - 120$$\n$$= 10e + 5b + 30t - 25$$\n\n**Difference:**\n$$\\text{Ava} - \\text{Emma} = (10e + 5b + 30t - 25) - (10e + 5b + 30t) = -25$$\n\nOr calculating the net change directly:\n- Enemies: $+8 \\times 10 = +80$ points\n- Berries: $+3 \\times 5 = +15$ points  \n- Time: $-4 \\times 30 = -120$ points\n- Total: $80 + 15 - 120 = -25$\n\nThe scores differ by 25 points.\n\nAnswer: 25", "correct": true, "gold": "25"}
