{"qid": "gsm:108", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "MAI-Thinking-1", "resp": "Let\u2019s denote Emma\u2019s score as $S_E = 10E + 5B + 30T$, where $E$ is enemies jumped, $B$ berries collected, and $T$ seconds left. \r\n\r\nAva\u2019s stats: $E + 8$ enemies, $B + 3$ berries, and $T - 4$ seconds left (since she finished 4 seconds slower). \r\n\r\nThus Ava\u2019s score is: \r\n$S_A = 10(E+8) + 5(B+3) + 30(T-4) = 10E + 80 + 5B + 15 + 30T - 120 = (10E + 5B + 30T) + (80 + 15 - 120) = S_E - 25$.\r\n\r\nThis means Ava\u2019s score is 25 points less than Emma\u2019s.\r\n\r\nAnswer: 25 points", "correct": true, "gold": "25"}
