{"qid": "gsm:119", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "anthropic/claude-sonnet-5", "resp": "**Setting up the problem:**\n\nTotal weekend time = 7 hours (Saturday) + 5 hours (Sunday) = 12 hours\n\n**Step 1: Subtract reading time**\nTime remaining after reading = 12 - 3 = 9 hours\n\n**Step 2: Calculate video game time**\nVideo games = 1/3 \u00d7 9 = 3 hours\n\n**Step 3: Calculate soccer time**\nSoccer = 9 - 3 = 6 hours\n\n**Step 4: Calculate percentage of weekend spent on soccer**\nPercentage = (6 / 12) \u00d7 100 = 50%\n\nAnswer: 50%", "correct": true, "gold": "50"}
