{"qid": "gsm:119", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "Kimi-K2.5", "resp": "Total weekend time: $7 + 5 = 12$ hours.\n\nAfter reading for 3 hours, remaining time is $12 - 3 = 9$ hours.\n\nShe plays video games for $\\frac{1}{3}$ of the remaining 9 hours, which is $\\frac{1}{3} \\times 9 = 3$ hours.\n\nThis leaves $9 - 3 = 6$ hours for soccer (or $\\frac{2}{3}$ of the remaining time).\n\nPercentage spent on soccer: $\\frac{6}{12} \\times 100\\% = 50\\%$.\n\nAnswer: 50%", "correct": true, "gold": "50"}
