{"qid": "gsm:120", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "Cohere-command-a-plus-05-2026", "resp": "<|START_TEXT|>The price after each year is multiplied by \\(1 - 0.21 = 0.79\\).\n\nFrom 2007 to 2010 there are 3 years, so:\n\n\\[\n\\text{Price}_{2010} = 20000 \\times (0.79)^3\n\\]\n\n\\[\n(0.79)^3 \\approx 0.493039\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\text{Price}_{2010} \\approx 20000 \\times 0.493039 \\approx \\$9{,}860.78\n\\]\n\nRounded to the nearest dollar, the car's price in 2010 is about \\$9,861.\n\nAnswer: $9,861 (approximately)<|END_TEXT|>", "correct": false, "gold": "7400"}
