{"qid": "gsm:119", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "MAI-Thinking-1", "resp": "Total weekend hours = 7 (Saturday) + 5 (Sunday) = 12 hours.\r\n\r\nTime spent reading = 3 hours, so remaining = 12 - 3 = 9 hours.\r\n\r\nTime spent playing video games = 1/3 of remaining = 1/3 \u00d7 9 = 3 hours.\r\n\r\nTime spent playing soccer = remaining after video games = 9 - 3 = 6 hours.\r\n\r\nPercentage = (6 / 12) \u00d7 100% = 50%.\r\n\r\nAnswer: 50%", "correct": true, "gold": "50"}
