{"qid": "gsm:125", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "openai/gpt-5.4", "resp": "Elaine started with 20 cards.\n\nAfter the first month, she collected 3 times that number:\n- First month: \\(3 \\times 20 = 60\\)\n\nIn the second month, she collected 20 fewer than in the first month:\n- Second month: \\(60 - 20 = 40\\)\n\nIn the third month, she collected twice the combined number from the first and second months:\n- First + second months: \\(60 + 40 = 100\\)\n- Third month: \\(2 \\times 100 = 200\\)\n\nNow add everything, including the 20 she started with:\n- Total: \\(20 + 60 + 40 + 200 = 320\\)\n\nAnswer: 320", "correct": true, "gold": "320"}
