{"qid": "gsm:126", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "anthropic/claude-sonnet-5", "resp": "**Answer: $1300**\n\nReasoning:\n- Total books sold over 3 years = 250 \u2212 50 (unsold) = 200 books.\n- This year's (Year 3) sales = 45 books.\n- Year 1 sales = 2 \u00d7 Year 3 sales = 2 \u00d7 45 = 90 books.\n- Year 2 sales = Total sold \u2212 Year 1 \u2212 Year 3 = 200 \u2212 90 \u2212 45 = 65 books.\n- Money earned in Year 2 = 65 books \u00d7 $20 = **$1300**.\n\nAnswer: $1300", "correct": true, "gold": "1300"}
