{"qid": "gsm:141", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "DeepSeek-V4-Flash", "resp": "Let\u2019s break it down step by step.\n\nTim starts with:  \n- Blue: 7  \n- Red: 9  \n\nHe uses 3 blue shoeboxes.  \nBlue left: \\( 7 - 3 = 4 \\)\n\nHe uses \\( \\frac{1}{3} \\) of his red shoeboxes.  \n\\( \\frac{1}{3} \\times 9 = 3 \\) red shoeboxes used.  \nRed left: \\( 9 - 3 = 6 \\)\n\nSo, blue left = 4, red left = 6.\n\nAnswer: 4 blue and 6 red", "correct": false, "gold": "10"}
