{"qid": "gsm:152", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "anthropic/claude-sonnet-5", "resp": "**Calculating the cost difference:**\n\n**Step 1:** Find the cost to repave Monica's street\n150 meters \u00d7 $194/meter = $29,100\n\n**Step 2:** Find the cost to repave Lewis' street\n490 meters \u00d7 $194/meter = $95,060\n\n**Step 3:** Find the difference in cost\n$95,060 \u2212 $29,100 = $65,960\n\nAnswer: $65,960", "correct": true, "gold": "65960"}
{"qid": "gsm:153", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "openai/gpt-5.4", "resp": "Regular pay for 40 hours: 40 \u00d7 $10 = $400\n\nOvertime rate: 1.2 \u00d7 $10 = $12 per hour\n\nOvertime hours: 45 \u2212 40 = 5 hours\n\nOvertime pay: 5 \u00d7 $12 = $60\n\nTotal earnings: $400 + $60 = $460\n\nAnswer: $460", "correct": true, "gold": "460"}
{"qid": "gsm:152", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "Kimi-K2.5", "resp": "To find how much more it costs to repave Lewis' street, first find the difference in length between the two streets: $490 - 150 = 340$ meters. Then multiply this difference by the cost per meter: $340 \\times \\$194 = \\$65,960$.\n\nAlternatively, calculate each cost separately:\n- Monica's street: $150 \\times \\$194 = \\$29,100$\n- Lewis' street: $490 \\times \\$194 = \\$95,060$\n- Difference: $\\$95,060 - \\$29,100 = \\$65,960$\n\nAnswer: $65960$ (or $65,960)", "correct": true, "gold": "65960"}
{"qid": "gsm:152", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "Cohere-command-a-plus-05-2026", "resp": "<|START_TEXT|>To find how much more it costs to repave Lewis' street compared to Monica's, first calculate the cost for each street using the rate of $194 per meter.\n\n- Monica's street: \\(150 \\text{ m} \\times \\$194/\\text{m} = \\$29{,}100\\)\n- Lewis' street: \\(490 \\text{ m} \\times \\$194/\\text{m} = \\$95{,}060\\)\n\nNow find the difference:\n\\(\\$95{,}060 - \\$29{,}100 = \\$65{,}960\\)\n\nAnswer: $65,960<|END_TEXT|>", "correct": true, "gold": "65960"}
