{"qid": "gsm:154", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "openai/gpt-5.4", "resp": "Compute net southward distance:\n\n- First leg: \\(10 \\times 30 = 300\\) miles south\n- Second leg: \\(2 \\times 18 = 36\\) miles north\n- Third leg: \\(5 \\times 22 = 110\\) miles south\n\nNet distance from northern home to southern home:\n\n\\(300 - 36 + 110 = 374\\) miles\n\nAnswer: 374", "correct": true, "gold": "374"}
