{"qid": "gsm:169", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "openai/gpt-5.4", "resp": "First 30 seconds: 20 kernels.\n\nNext 30 seconds: three times that amount = 60.\n\nNext 30 seconds: four times the initial amount = 80.\n\nFinal 30 seconds: half of the previous 30 seconds = 40.\n\nAfter heat is off: a quarter of the final 30-second amount = 10.\n\nTotal popcorn pieces:\n20 + 60 + 80 + 40 + 10 = 210\n\nAnswer: 210", "correct": true, "gold": "210"}
{"qid": "gsm:169", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "Kimi-K2.5", "resp": "Here's the step-by-step calculation:\n\n**First 30 seconds:** 20 kernels pop\n\n**Next 30 seconds:** 3 \u00d7 20 = 60 kernels pop\n\n**Next 30 seconds:** 4 \u00d7 the initial rate (20) = 80 kernels pop\n\n**Final 30 seconds:** Half the previous rate (80) = 40 kernels pop\n\n**After removing from heat:** \u00bc of the final 30-second amount (40) = 10 kernels pop\n\n**Total:** 20 + 60 + 80 + 40 + 10 = **210**\n\nAnswer: 210", "correct": true, "gold": "210"}
{"qid": "gsm:169", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "DeepSeek-V4-Flash", "resp": "Let's break it down step by step.\n\n- **First 30 seconds:** 20 kernels pop.  \n- **Next 30 seconds:** 3 times that amount \u2192 \\( 3 \\times 20 = 60 \\) kernels pop.  \n- **Next 30 seconds:** 4 times the initial rate \u2192 \\( 4 \\times 20 = 80 \\) kernels pop.  \n- **Final 30 seconds:** half the rate of the past 30 seconds \u2192 \\( \\frac{1}{2} \\times 80 = 40 \\) kernels pop.  \n\nTotal popped during cooking:  \n\\( 20 + 60 + 80 + 40 = 200 \\).\n\n- **After removing from heat:** a quarter of the final 30 seconds' amount pops:  \n\\( \\frac{1}{4} \\times 40 = 10 \\) kernels.\n\nTotal popcorn:  \n\\( 200 + 10 = 210 \\).\n\nAnswer: 210", "correct": true, "gold": "210"}
{"qid": "gsm:169", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "anthropic/claude-sonnet-5", "resp": "**Setting up each interval:**\n\n- First 30 seconds: 20 kernels pop\n- Second 30 seconds: 3 \u00d7 20 = 60 kernels pop\n- Third 30 seconds: 4 \u00d7 20 = 80 kernels pop\n- Fourth 30 seconds: half the rate of the third interval = 80 \u00f7 2 = 40 kernels pop\n- After heat removed: \u00bc \u00d7 40 = 10 kernels pop from residual heat\n\n**Total popcorn:**\n20 + 60 + 80 + 40 + 10 = **210**\n\nAnswer: 210", "correct": true, "gold": "210"}
