{"qid": "gsm:169", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "grok-4.3", "resp": "The problem involves five successive stages of popping, which must be calculated in sequence based on the rates and quantities described.\n\n- Stage 1 (first 30 s): exactly 20 kernels pop.\n- Stage 2 (next 30 s): three times the preceding amount, therefore \\(3 \\times 20 = 60\\) kernels.\n- The initial rate is therefore defined by the first interval: 20 kernels per 30 s.  \n  Stage 3 (next 30 s) occurs at four times that initial rate, therefore \\(4 \\times 20 = 80\\) kernels.\n- Stage 4 (final 30 s) occurs at half the immediately preceding rate, therefore \\(\\frac12 \\times 80 = 40\\) kernels.\n- Residual stage (after heat is removed): one-quarter of the kernels that popped in the final cooking interval, therefore \\(\\frac14 \\times 40 = 10\\) kernels.\n\nSumming the five quantities yields the total number of popped kernels:  \n\\(20 + 60 + 80 + 40 + 10 = 210\\).\n\nGarrett therefore has 210 pieces of popcorn.\n\nAnswer: 210", "correct": true, "gold": "210"}
{"qid": "gsm:171", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "openai/gpt-5.4", "resp": "The levels form a geometric pattern where each lower level has double the square footage of the level above it.\n\nTop level: 16  \nNext level: 32  \nThird level: 64  \nBottom level: 128\n\nTotal square footage:\n16 + 32 + 64 + 128 = 240\n\nAverage square footage:\n240 \u00f7 4 = 60\n\nAnswer: 60", "correct": true, "gold": "60"}
{"qid": "gsm:171", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "DeepSeek-V4-Flash", "resp": "We know the top level (level 4) has 16 square feet.  \nEach level below is twice the square footage of the one above (since each level is half the one below).  \n\n- Level 4: 16  \n- Level 3: 16 \u00d7 2 = 32  \n- Level 2: 32 \u00d7 2 = 64  \n- Level 1: 64 \u00d7 2 = 128  \n\nNow, average square footage = (16 + 32 + 64 + 128) / 4  \nSum = 240  \nAverage = 240 / 4 = 60  \n\nAnswer: 60", "correct": true, "gold": "60"}
{"qid": "gsm:169", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "Cohere-command-a-plus-05-2026", "resp": "<|START_TEXT|>First 30\u202fs: 20 kernels  \nNext 30\u202fs: 3\u202f\u00d7\u202f20\u202f=\u202f60 kernels  \nNext 30\u202fs: 4\u202f\u00d7\u202f20\u202f=\u202f80 kernels (four times the initial rate)  \nFinal 30\u202fs: half the rate of the previous interval \u2192 \u00bd\u202f\u00d7\u202f80\u202f=\u202f40 kernels  \nResidual heat: \u00bc\u202f\u00d7\u202f40\u202f=\u202f10 kernels  \n\nTotal popped = 20\u202f+\u202f60\u202f+\u202f80\u202f+\u202f40\u202f+\u202f10 = **210**.\n\nAnswer: 210<|END_TEXT|>", "correct": true, "gold": "210"}
