{"qid": "gsm:179", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "openai/gpt-5.4", "resp": "If Madeline pays 60% of the $400 monthly grocery cost, then Keenan pays the remaining 40%.\n\n- Keenan\u2019s monthly share: \\(0.40 \\times 400 = 160\\)\n- In a 4-week month, per week: \\(160 \\div 4 = 40\\)\n\nAnswer: $40", "correct": true, "gold": "40"}
