{"qid": "gsm:184", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "openai/gpt-5.4", "resp": "He starts by driving away from home:\n\n- \\(3\\) hours at \\(60\\) mph \\(= 3 \\times 60 = 180\\) miles from home.\n\nNow he heads back and has \\(4\\) hours total to get home:\n\n1. First \\(2\\) hours in traffic: \\(0\\) miles\n2. Next \\(0.5\\) hour at \\(30\\) mph: \\(0.5 \\times 30 = 15\\) miles\n3. Remaining time: \\(4 - 2 - 0.5 = 1.5\\) hours at \\(80\\) mph: \\(1.5 \\times 80 = 120\\) miles\n\nTotal distance traveled back toward home:\n\n- \\(15 + 120 = 135\\) miles\n\nHe was \\(180\\) miles away, so distance still from home:\n\n- \\(180 - 135 = 45\\) miles\n\nAnswer: 45 miles", "correct": true, "gold": "45"}
