{"qid": "gsm:186", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "anthropic/claude-sonnet-5", "resp": "**Setting up the equation:**\n\nLet x = number of coffee mugs\n\n\"Four times the number of coffee mugs\" = 4x\n\"Eight more than\" that = 4x + 8\nThis equals 40:\n\n4x + 8 = 40\n\n**Solving:**\n\n4x = 40 - 8\n4x = 32\nx = 8\n\n**Answer:** 8", "correct": true, "gold": "8"}
