{"qid": "gsm:186", "domain": "gsm8k", "model": "MAI-Thinking-1", "resp": "Let $m$ be the number of coffee mugs in the teacher's lounge. \r\n\r\nWe can set up the equation based on the problem statement: \r\n\r\n$4m + 8 = 40$\r\n\r\nNow, solve for $m$: \r\n\r\n$4m = 40 - 8 = 32$\r\n\r\n$m = \\frac{32}{4} = 8$\r\n\r\nAnswer: 8", "correct": true, "gold": "8"}
