{"qid": "med:290", "domain": "medqa", "model": "openai/gpt-5.4", "resp": "This presentation is classic for **typhoid (enteric) fever**:\n\n- Travel to **Indonesia**\n- **Stepwise fever**\n- Early **constipation** followed by **profuse diarrhea**\n- **Abdominal pain**\n- **Hepatosplenomegaly**\n- **Rose spots** (faint salmon-colored maculopapular rash on trunk)\n\nThe causative organism is **Salmonella enterica serovar Typhi**, a **gram-negative rod** transmitted via contaminated food or water.\n\nAnswer: **Salmonella typhi**", "correct": true, "gold": "Salmonella typhi"}
