{"qid": "mp:8789", "domain": "mmlupro:math", "model": "grok-4.3", "resp": "The expression is evaluated using the standard order of operations (parentheses first, then multiplication and division from left to right).\n\n- Evaluate inside the parentheses: \\(8 - 5 = 3\\).\n- The expression simplifies to \\(6 \\cdot 24 \\div 3\\).\n- Perform multiplication and division left to right: first \\(6 \\cdot 24 = 144\\), then \\(144 \\div 3 = 48\\).\n\n(Equivalently, \\(6 \\cdot (24 \\div 3) = 6 \\cdot 8 = 48\\).)\n\nAnswer: 48", "correct": true, "gold": "48"}
